    {
      "name": "dshtavern",
      "title": {
        "en": "DSH-Tavern",
        "zh": "DSH-Tavern"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Turn the DeepSeek Harness into a role-play tavern. Mark any folder as a tavern, start a chat inside it, and a director writes the narration and decides who speaks next while each character answers from its own card in a separate call — so two characters never bleed into each other, and neither sees the director's private plot. Ships a toolbox for character cards, worldbooks, prompt and agent settings.",
        "zh": "把 DeepSeek Harness 变成可以角色扮演的酒馆。把一个文件夹标记成酒馆，在里面开聊天，就会有一个「导演」负责旁白和安排谁先开口，每个角色再按自己的设定单独说话——所以两个角色不会串味，也看不到导演心里的剧情。附带角色卡、世界书、提示词编排、Agent 编排等工具。"
      },
      "author": "prophetcrab",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/prophetcrab/DSHTavern#readme",
      "repository": {
